TestAudit -- test audit functionality
*************************************

Description
===========

The TestAudit package provides a small report about the tests of a package. The
report lists the number and location of tests, classifies how tests are
organized, and gives simple textual checks for exported functions, options,
silenced tests, and FIXME or TODO comments.

