testAudit -- produce a test audit report for a package
******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        testAudit pkg
        testAudit(pkg, CommentReport => true, SpeedReport => true, ScoreReport => true)
  * Inputs:
      * pkg, a *note package: (Macaulay2Doc)Package, or a *note string:
        (Macaulay2Doc)String,,
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * CommentReport => a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, default
        value false
      * SpeedReport => a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, default
        value false
      * ScoreReport => a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, default
        value false
      * Experimental (missing documentation) => ..., default value false, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, the audit report

Description
===========

Returns a string report about the tests of pkg. The default report summarizes
test sources, test organization, untested exported functions and options,
silenced tests, and FIXME or TODO markers around test blocks.

Optional Boolean arguments add sections: CommentReport includes comments
attached to tests, SpeedReport times tests with *note check:
(Macaulay2Doc)check,, and ScoreReport includes the heuristic score returned by
*note testScore: testScore,.

+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : testAudit "TestAudit"                                   |
|                                                             |
|o1 = exported: 2 functions, 0 types, 4 other symbols         |
|     n_tests: 5                                              |
|     style: together                                         |
|                                                             |
|     test sources:                                           |
|         - ../../../../../Macaulay2/packages/TestAudit.m2:614|
|                                                             |
|     Report:                                                 |
|                                                             |
|     - untested functions (0):                               |
|         none                                                |
|                                                             |
|     - untested options (1):                                 |
|         - testAudit: Experimental                           |
|                                                             |
|     - silenced tests (0):                                   |
|         none                                                |
|                                                             |
|     - FIXME/TODO markers (0):                               |
|         none                                                |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+

