testScore -- compute the heuristic test score for a package
***********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        testScore pkg
  * Inputs:
      * pkg, a *note package: (Macaulay2Doc)Package, or a *note string:
        (Macaulay2Doc)String,,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note real number: (Macaulay2Doc)RR,, the heuristic test score

Description
===========

This function returns only the numerical score that appears in the ScoreReport
section of *note testAudit: testAudit,. The score is out of 100.

+--------------------------+
|i1 : testScore "TestAudit"|
|                          |
|o1 = 84                   |
|                          |
|o1 : RR (of precision 53) |
+--------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note testAudit: testAudit, -- produce a test audit report for a package

